        {
          "text": "Lino kumatalikilo aamwaaka mupya, kuciindi bami ncibaya kuyoolwana, Davida wakatuma Joabu abalanda bakwe aba-Israyeli boonse, nkabela bakanyonyoona ba-Amoni akusinkinizya munzi wa-Raba. Pele Davida kakede ku-Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
