                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davida wakatuma batumwa kuyoomwiita, nkabela wakasika kulinguwe, wakalala awe, ciindi ncaakali kulisalazya kubusofwaazi bwakwe, elyo kusule wakabweeda kulinguwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.4",
