        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Uriya wakavwiila Davida kuti, Ibbokesi lya-Leza aba-Israyeli aba-Juda boonse balikede muzilao, alakwe Joabu abalanda basimalelaangu boonse baloona musokwe, Lino mebo sa ndakonzya kuya kuŋanda yangu kuyoolya akunywa akulala amukangu? Mboli muumi, am buli moyo wako mbuuli muumi, ncobeni nsikonzyi kucita obo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
